# Sweta Pandey — Portfolio

Personal portfolio site showcasing my background as a Program & Operations Leader with 7+ years across EdTech and higher education.

🔗 **Live site:** https://heyitsweta.github.io/Sweta-portfolio/

## What's inside
- Summary of my experience and core strengths
- Key achievements and quantified impact
- Selected case studies (Situation / Action / Impact)
- Full work experience timeline
- Skills, tools, and education
- Downloadable resume (PDF)

## Built with
Plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no frameworks, single-file site.

